problems.q:
다음 벡터들의 선형결합 전체를 기하적으로(직선, 평면, \(\mathbf R^3\) 전체 중 무엇인지) 설명하시오.
(a) \(\begin{bmatrix}1\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}3\\6\\9\end{bmatrix}\) &nbsp;
(b) \(\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}0\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\) &nbsp;
(c) \(\begin{bmatrix}2\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}0\\2\\2\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}2\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\)

problems.q_sub:
Describe geometrically (line, plane, or all of \(\mathbf R^3\)) all linear combinations of
(a) \(\begin{bmatrix}1\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\) and \(\begin{bmatrix}3\\6\\9\end{bmatrix}\) &nbsp;
(b) \(\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}\) and \(\begin{bmatrix}0\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\) &nbsp;
(c) \(\begin{bmatrix}2\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}0\\2\\2\end{bmatrix}\), \(\begin{bmatrix}2\\2\\3\end{bmatrix}\)

problems.q:
다음 네 직선 중 서로 평행한 것은 어느 것인가? 일치하는 직선이 있는가?
\(L_1:\;x=1+6t,\;y=1-3t,\;z=12t+5\); \(L_2:\;x=1+2t,\;y=t,\;z=1+4t\);
\(L_3:\;2x-2=4-4y=z+1\); \(L_4:\;\mathbf r=\langle3,1,5\rangle+t\langle4,2,8\rangle\)

problems.q_sub:
Which of the following four lines are parallel? Are any of them identical?
\(L_1:\;x=1+6t,\;y=1-3t,\;z=12t+5\); \(L_2:\;x=1+2t,\;y=t,\;z=1+4t\);
\(L_3:\;2x-2=4-4y=z+1\); \(L_4:\;\mathbf r=\langle3,1,5\rangle+t\langle4,2,8\rangle\)
